# Robot Domination's third-plan-counter trigger, with the enchantment gone: "sacrifice it and create three 2/2 colorless
# Robot Villain artifact creature tokens" are two instructions, and the second does not depend on the first. Bot1 reaches
# the third plan counter as in the main scenario (a mill, its Ornithopter bolted, two Ornithopters milled at once), and
# Bot2 destroys the enchantment with Disenchant in response to the trigger. Nothing can be sacrificed (CR 701.21a), but
# Bot1 still gets its three Robot Villains.

